    "Traffic Flow Stats": "Real-time tracking of passenger flow and alarm frequency",
    "360° LED Indicators": "Quad-pillar LED strips for all-angle threat visibility",
    "Audio-Visual Alerts": "Adjustable voice prompts and synchronized light bars",
    "Core Processor": "6-core high-performance CPU (frequency >1.8GHz)",
    "Remote Operation": "Wireless mouse/keyboard setup with hierarchical password protection",
